            <section class="section">
                <h2>Benefits of SUV Car Rental for Your Travels</h2>

                <div>

                    <h3>1. Spacious Interiors for Passengers and Luggage</h3>
                    <p>
                        One of the standout features of SUVs is their generous interior space. Unlike smaller vehicles, SUVs can comfortably
                        accommodate larger groups of passengers, making them ideal for family vacations or group outings. The ample legroom
                        and headroom ensure that everyone can relax during long journeys. Additionally, the cargo space is designed to handle
                        substantial luggage, sports equipment, or even camping gear, eliminating the stress of overpacking or leaving essentials
                        behind. With foldable seats in many models, you can easily customize the space to fit your needs.
                    </p>

                    <div class="section-images">
                        <img src="~/Pages/Articles/SUV-Rental-Davao/SUV-Rental-In-Davao/SUV-Rental-In-Davao-fortuner-back-seat.webp" height="250" />
