                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3>2. Comfort on Rough and Uneven Roads</h3>
                    <p>
                        Traveling through the Davao region or other destinations with diverse terrains? SUVs are built for the challenge.
                        Their sturdy construction and advanced suspension systems allow for a smooth ride, even on rough and uneven roads.
                        Whether you’re exploring remote mountain trails, navigating countryside paths, or driving through construction zones
                        in urban areas, an SUV ensures that you and your passengers remain comfortable throughout the journey.
                        Many SUVs also come with all-wheel or four-wheel drive capabilities, providing enhanced traction and stability on
                        slippery or rugged surfaces.
                    </p>
                    <div class="section-images">
